> ## Part A2. Real records: EHR (PIMA Indians Diabetes)
> The EHR results in Part B use simulated hospitals. This part runs the EHR comparison on a small public set of real records instead, split across the four hospitals. It is real data, but not hospital EHR: 768 women of one population, 8 features, one outcome.
