> ## Part B. Simulated data: pipeline validation, not evidence
> These runs check that the experiment pipeline, the methods and the reporting behave as expected on every modality. The simulated hospitals are fictional and the simulators are easy (simulated ECG reaches macro-F1 near 0.99), so a high score here shows that the simulator is easy, not that a method works. Do not cite these numbers as results.
